OL,3,GNEWSAGas leak causes series of road
OL,4,Aclosures
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gas leak has caused a series of road
OL,7,Fclosures in Jersey as repair work takes
OL,8,Fplace.
OL,10,FSt Saviour's Hill has been shut at the
OL,11,Fjunction of Deloraine Road and St
OL,12,FSaviour's Hill, with 15 firefighters at
OL,13,Fthe scene, police said. People were
OL,14,Fadvised to avoid the area.
OL,16,FIsland Energy said it was alerted to
OL,17,Fthe leak by a member of the public who
OL,18,Fsmelt gas on St Saviour's Hill on
OL,19,FWednesday evening.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
