OL,3,GNEWSAGas leak causes series of road
OL,4,Aclosures
OL,5,
OL,6,FEngineers found the leak in the mains
OL,7,Fnetwork near the junction of Deloraine
OL,8,FRoad and Chasse Brunet, with work
OL,9,Fcarried out overnight and continuing
OL,10,Funtil it is fixed, the firm said.
